Design and behaviour derived from illogical-impulse / end4-pC
-------------------------------------------------------------
This project reimplements, for Windows, the desktop experience of

  end4-pC          https://github.com/pctrade/end4-pC          (GPL-3.0)
  illogical-impulse https://github.com/end-4/dots-hyprland     (GPL-3.0)

No QML is copied — the original targets Quickshell and Wayland, neither of which
exists on Windows — but the layout, the interaction model and several algorithms
follow those projects closely, in particular:

  * the layer/state token derivation in modules/common/Appearance.qml
  * ColorUtils.solveOverlayColor, and the wallpaper-vibrancy transparency curve
  * the wallpaper → Material 3 pipeline of scripts/colors/switchwall.sh
  * the online wallpaper provider normalisation of services/OnlineWallpapers.qml
  * the GlobalStates surface-flag model and the IpcHandler target vocabulary

The user-interface translations in apps/shell/src/i18n/locales are taken from
end4-pC's translations/ directory.


Not included
------------
end4-pC's assets/icons/ (third-party brand and distribution logos) and its
default wallpaper are deliberately not redistributed here: neither carries
provenance or licence information in the upstream repository.
